Package: surge-xt-for-rpi
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libasound2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libpng16-16, libbrotli1, libexpat1, libstdc++6, libc6
Maintainer: Bill Allen <pb@ballen.fastmail.fm>
Homepage: https://surge-synthesizer.github.io
Description: Surge XT synthesizer (Raspberry Pi build)
 Surge XT is an open-source hybrid synthesizer with a large patch library.
 This package provides builds compiled for ARM64/aarch64 hardware.
 .
 Includes surge-xt (standalone GUI), surge-xt-cli (headless CLI),
 and surge-xt-fx (effects processor)
